# The data happy-svc-ctl may import and backs up: Docker volume names, exactly as the
# compose files name them (vault-init.sh creates them; compose declares them external with
# an explicit `name:`), one per line. browser-home is not a volume: it is
# ~happy-svc/data/browser, the browser stack's HAPPY_BROWSER_HOME.
happy-vault-data
happy-vault-config
happy-vault-backups
happy-filler
browser-home
